#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "CAP-RELEASE Reconciliation and release"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "Results are released per unit only when the unit reconciles against its register."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "Layer L3 · domain: product · depends on: [CAP-REVIEW]{1}."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "Results are released only when every expected subject is accounted for."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "Why"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "Once results are released, they can't be taken back. Reconciling them against an external register is the last check before that point."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "Interfaces"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "A gate that reads BLOCKED or CLEAR for each release unit."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-release.md
msgid "A snapshot of the register for each sitting."
msgstr ""

